<title>HONDURAS: Honduras coffee reference price for Aug 4.</title>
<headline>Honduras coffee reference price for Aug 4.</headline>
<dateline>TEGUCIGALPA, Honduras 1997-08-04</dateline>
<text>
<p>Honduras Coffee Institute reported local reference prices per 100 lb quintal bags (46 kg bags).</p>
<p>    Type		    Price		   Previous</p>
<p>    Prime washed -- 2,066.00 lempiras   2,059.00 lempiras</p>
<p>Exchange Rate 13.0754/dollar. Previous 13.0770/dollar</p>
<p>CSCE September contracts closed at $193.75, up $8.80 in the session.</p>
<p>((--Chris Aspin, Mexico City newsroom +525 7289530)) E-mail at chris.aspin@reuters.com</p>
